* MINT-ERRORS: 10
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:165
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
USE BASE
GO 2
REPLACE CITY WITH "HONOLULU"
? "[DEFAULT UNIQUE OFF]"
INDEX ON CITY TO ALLKEYS
LIST NAME, CITY
SET UNIQUE ON
INDEX ON CITY TO ONEKEY
? "[UNIQUE ON DUPLICATE OMITTED]"
LIST NAME, CITY
SET UNIQUE OFF
INDEX ON CITY TO ALLAGAIN
? "[UNIQUE OFF DUPLICATE RESTORED]"
LIST NAME, CITY
? "[BAD TOGGLE]"
SET UNIQUE MAYBE
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
